<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8"></head><body>Hi everyone,<br><br>Friendly reminder that all Q2 travel and expense reports are due by end of day Friday, July 25.<br><br>A few reminders on our T&amp;E policy:<br>- All expenses over $25 require itemized receipts (photos of receipts are fine)<br>- Per diem rates: $55/day for meals, $150/night lodging (domestic), $200/night (international)<br>- Mileage reimbursement: $0.67/mile (2026 IRS rate)<br>- Please use the updated expense form on the shared drive (Finance &gt; Forms &gt; Expense-Report-2026.xlsx)<br><br>If you have any charges on the company card that need to be reconciled, please include those as well.<br><br>Late submissions delay our month-end close, so I appreciate everyone getting these in on time.<br><br>Thank you,<br>Adele Vance<br>Controller<br>Waverly Industrial Solutions, Inc.</body></html>

